### Examples
```json
{
  "nextStep": {
    "type": "Pipeline",
    "pipeline": {
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "Search Records",
          "with": {}
        },
        {
          "where": "Status == 'Rejected'"
        },
        {
          "select": [
            "ID",
            "Email"
          ]
        },
        {
          "first": 10
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
Batch action chain (intermediates never in context):
```json
{
  "nextStep": {
    "type": "Pipeline",
    "pipeline": {
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "Search Records",
          "with": {}
        },
        {
          "where": "Balance > 0"
        },
        {
          "map": {
            "as": "row",
            "do": [
              {
                "tool": "Search Records",
                "with": {
                  "Note": "{{row.ID}}"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "count": true
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
Tabular artifact tool — `get_rows` yields the row objects directly; filter and shape them with no unwrapping:
```json
{
  "nextStep": {
    "type": "Pipeline",
    "pipeline": {
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_rows",
          "with": {
            "artifactId": "A",
            "start": 0,
            "count": 500
          }
        },
        {
          "where": "Department == 'Engineering' and Status == 'Active'"
        },
        {
          "select": [
            "EmployeeID",
            "Name",
            "Region"
          ]
        },
        {
          "distinct": "Region"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
Analytical question over a LARGE file — aggregate server-side, return a tiny summary (the raw rows never enter your context, so this works even when the file is too big to read whole):
```json
{
  "nextStep": {
    "type": "Pipeline",
    "pipeline": {
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "get_full",
          "with": {
            "artifactId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "groupBy": {
            "by": "Category",
            "sum": "Amount",
            "avg": "Amount"
          }
        },
        {
          "sort": "-sum_Amount"
        },
        {
          "first": 10
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```






